llenge for yourself and create your empire from scratch.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/674090/extras/a70951ad233744ea33dfb9e2e944d892.poster.avif?t=1669065139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/674090/extras/a70951ad233744ea33dfb9e2e944d892.webm?t=1669065139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/674090/extras/a70951ad233744ea33dfb9e2e944d892.mp4?t=1669065139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The strategy you create matters and determines how your airport looks and works. Remote or bridged ramps? Charter or regular flights? Big or small aircrafts? Domestic passengers or connected flights? Fly single planes or entire airlines? You are the manager of this tycoon/simulation and the world is your sandbox.",
